rt of me that had that and and  I realized like you know what this is  this is something that when you look at  Kratos he looks at God went like a  disease he looks at there's something he  passed on to him and for Kratos he  wanted one thing above all else right it  wasn't vengeance I hope you'll think  okay this is all better no he wanted to  forget he didn't want to have not done  the things that he did he didn't want to  make up for the things  did he wanted somebody to erase it so he  didn't have to carry the memory so the  early edicts that I had with the writers  was saying that you know work years and  we may only succeed in a single moment  of truth in the entire game and if we  succeed in that single moment of truth  we still have a victory right I would  love it if we push ourselves further  beyond that and we have so many moments  of truth throughout all of this game and  all of that is born from being able to  put the mirror on ourselves  [Music]  [Music]  you  [Music]

